  "question": {
    "text": "A line parallel to the straight line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is tangent to the hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;at the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
